{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104120","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910412001:1":{"text":"What's gotten into you two?! Are you serious about going even deeper?!","source_cn":"还要下潜？你们都疯了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x181BCC84EDCF217C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910412002:1":{"text":"Just think about everything we've been through! We nearly got dissolved in a pool, got chased by half the Shallowfolk in Coralia, and even got attacked by a bunch of crazed Deepfolk!","source_cn":"你想想一路上咱们都碰到了什么？！被当做养料，被半座城的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB176F796EDA1EC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910412003:1":{"text":"And now some tentacle guy is hauling us off to a godforsaken shipwreck!","source_cn":"现在，又冒出个触手男叫咱去什么沉船？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21F1F7B739F6B583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910412004:1":{"text":"I've learned my lesson! Nobody in the sea can be trusted! Every time I took a leap of faith, I ended up paying for it!","source_cn":"咱算是知道了，海里根本没有什么好人！大个子，别和他们走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495521201F176E2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910412004":{"text":"I've learned my lesson! Nobody in the sea can be trusted! Every time I took a leap of faith, I ended up paying for it!","source_cn":"咱算是知道了，海里根本没有什么好人！大个子，别和他们走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495521201F176E2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910412005:1":{"text":"... There you go again!","source_cn":"……哈，又是这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA57514A0FF235B30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910412006:0":{"text":"You keep going on about things that make no sense to me, and before I know it, you've dragged us out of the frying pan and into the fire!","source_cn":"一边念叨着咱听不懂的东西，一边头也不回地往前跑。结果呢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67ED338AA2DA79EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910412007:1":{"text":"Tolan, I... I can tell you're feeling overwhelmed...","source_cn":"图澜，我……我能感受到，你的情绪中有焦虑，有害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEB75C20896A1B0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910412008:1":{"text":"I'm just as lost as you are! But that's all the more reason to keep going and find some answers—","source_cn":"我也一样，不明白发生了什么，心里装着好多问题，都得不到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D49EE519CD37EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910412009:1":{"text":"Oh, sure! You've all got your reasons! As always!","source_cn":"“理由”！哈，没错，你们每个人都有理由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36F770DABA9053EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910412010:1":{"text":"You know what I hate most? These \"reasons\"!","source_cn":"你知道咱最烦的是什么吗？咱最烦的就是这些理由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD38DB228DC1AFD88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910412011:1":{"text":"In what world is it okay to throw your friends into a pool just because you need nutrients for reproduction?! And why should we risk our necks helping some crazy fish?!","source_cn":"因为洄游季养料不够，就想把咱和大个子都融成能量；因为那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D755679FA2526B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910412012:1":{"text":"It's not right to drag innocent people into danger just because you think your cause is noble!","source_cn":"这个理由，那个原因……讲得那么好听，最后还不是想把不相...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9804DE26581FE255","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1910412012":{"text":"It's not right to drag innocent people into danger just because you think your cause is noble!","source_cn":"这个理由，那个原因……讲得那么好听，最后还不是想把不相干的人拖下水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9804DE26581FE255","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910412013:1":{"text":"Did I say anything wrong?! I can't believe you two are treating me the same way those Shallowfolk and Deepfolk treated us!","source_cn":"咱难道说错了？！那群浅海裔是这样，追咱们的那群深海鱼是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FA11973F75C1854","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910412014:1":{"text":"W-We're different from them!","source_cn":"我……我们和他们不一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBAF3CE152E7342C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910412015:1":{"text":"Different? How? You're Merfolk too, and your family tried to turn me into nutrients!","source_cn":"不一样？你不也是海裔吗，你家不也想让咱和大个子当养料吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969CB9FBA272A78E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910412016:1":{"text":"Why should I have to suffer and die because of your problems?!","source_cn":"你们一个个都有理由，都有难处！那咱就活该遭罪，活该送命？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34F3F1BE47424753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","vari